/* Bot source: "Bot discovers and connects to your Bot gateway on the local network." */
"NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription" = "Bot, yerel ağdaki Bot gateway'inizi keşfeder ve ona bağlanır.";
/* Bot source: "Bot can share your location in the background when you enable Always." */
